A1 > A4 > A5
A5 > D3
MCrit --> Gauntlet: the critic hands it over — D-086 A. The three gates are OUTSIDE the loop and in the BACKLOG — not deferred, they just need a finished candidate to run on (D-086 D)
Gauntlet --> C5: the ONLY thing condition 5 would read

