Guards [color: grey, icon: shield, label: "14 · scripts/ — the tooling that checks the WORK · NAMED BY NO PHASE\n⚠ TWO OF THE THREE ARE DELIBERATELY UNTRACKED — this label said COMMITTED until 2026-08-21"] {
  CheckDiag [color: red, icon: image, label: "check-diagram.py — the D-021 guard, TEN milestones · local, not tracked\nit reads DECISIONS.md and DEFECTS.md, which are gitignored — published it would resolve nothing\nthe only check that reads the RENDER, not the source"]
  CheckNodes [color: red, icon: crosshair, label: "check-diagram-nodes.sh — D-068 · local, not tracked\nevery path-and-line node resolves\nAMBIGUITY FAILS — tau2 has six files of one name"]
